DELTA-X v2 is released under two licences.

CODE — MIT
    harness/, analysis/, repro/scripts/, grader/check_scorecard.py, env/probe_env.sh,
    the Makefile, and any other source file in this repository.
    Full text: LICENSE-MIT

EVERYTHING ELSE — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    tasks/, data/, grader/ (the key, the scoring rules, the baselines and their
    records), docs/, repro/REPRODUCTION.md, and the two READMEs.
    Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The curated sequence sets in data/ were built from UniProt, which publishes its
data under CC BY 4.0. Attribution for them runs to UniProt as well as to this
repository; repro/REPRODUCTION.md records the exact queries and the release date.

If you publish a measurement made with this benchmark, cite it as CITATION.cff
specifies and include your scorecard's measured_scope field. A score whose scope
is not stated is not comparable to one whose is.
